@grid 9 10

#
TIC-TAC-TOE | Player X vs Computer O

Tap only the center of an empty 3×3 square. X uses four corners plus its center; O uses the perimeter.
Input centers: (1,2), (4,2), (7,2), (1,5), (4,5), (7,5), (1,8), (4,8), (7,8).
Status row y=0: reset (0,0), X turn (2,0), O turn (3,0), X win (5,0), O win (6,0), draw (7,0), game over (8,0).
Cell (1,0) is the internal engine-enable flag; leave it at 1 while playing.
Run settings: Step limit 1,000,000; speed Fast.
#

